<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Endesa cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Endesa cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities analyst Suzy Mayne on Thursday cut her rating for Spanish electricity company Endesa to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Over the next few months we see the Spanish utility sector moving into an intense regulatory period in which they will all be fighting over regulatory income,&quot; she wrote in an analysis.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Although ELE is likely to feel the most comfortable of the utilities during these negotiations, it is difficult to see how the stock will outperform during this process.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were off 3/4 to 72-3/8 in late afternoon trade.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
